    {
      "name": "Dispelling Critical",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "On a critical hit with a halberd Strike, shards of noqual built into the clockwork Belimarius glow green for a moment. Instead of inflicting additional damage with the critical hit, the clockwork Belimarius instead attempts a counteract check with a +18 bonus against one magical effect active on the target."
